    "blurb": "Provides out-of-the-box PDF manipulation",
    "overview": "Automate the splitting and merging of PDF documents, removing the need for external services, manual editing, or custom scripts. This connector is ideal for document-heavy processes, especially where scanned or multi-form PDFs need to be transformed into structured, workflow-ready files.",
