  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Provides out-of-the-box PDF manipulation.",
    "splashDescription": "This connector provides out-of-the-box PDF manipulation capabilities directly in Camunda-based processes. Designed as an outbound connector, it enables automated splitting and merging of PDF documents, removing the need for external services, manual editing, or custom scripts. This connector is ideal for document-heavy processes, especially where scanned or multi-form PDFs need to be transformed into structured, workflow-ready files.",
